The army's movement, fighting and retreat run on lib.groups (ai/lib/groups.lua: forming, legs, per-unit targets,
the raid flight, the retreat), standing in for EECPAttackGroup / EECPAttackSubGroup / the ASG* state machines.

DEVIATION (fog) at the start: the C++ classic's forest finder and resource centres read the whole map; the port sees
what is explored (a town centre's few tiles at the start), so an idle citizen with nothing known to gather explores
(econ.lua) until the finders know a resource.

