ai.find_site's `margin` and `far` options, ai.water_sites (the dock sites), ai.area / ai.area_point (the
continent manager's areas: AssignSeaTask), ai.tuning's map tiles (water, land, space, the largest sea: GetDomainShare),
ai.enemy_near with the manifest's sees_all (HasEnemyNear), ai.garrison_fill with its fills_garrison (FillGarrison),
